   const serverTime = new Date().toLocaleTimeString();
   return <Clock initialTime={serverTime} />;
   ```

   The client's first render uses `initialTime`, so server and client HTML match.

2. **Render it only after mount.** If it genuinely must be "live" client time, gate it behind an effect so the first client render matches the server:

